  "description": "Full suspension for the next adventure. Our ADVENTR 9 with 29″ wheels combines the advantages of an eFully with the comfort and setup of an eTrekking bike. The result is a sporty eSUV that masters almost all challenges on two wheels with flying colours. This is also ensured by the comprehensive all-round equipment: with the Yamaha PW-S2 motor including a 720Wh battery, 140mm suspension travel at the front and rear, plus the high-quality shifting and braking components from Sram and Magura, you are perfectly equipped for the daily commute as well as for multi-day tours through more demanding terrain. Practical: thanks to the Modular Rail System, you can attach additional accessories in just a few steps. With a luggage rack, mudguards and integrated lighting, you are also compliant with the StVZO. So what are you waiting for? It’s time for your next adventure!",
